# Per-course, per-link comparisons: transferable idea / boundary that must be re-evaluated.
RELATIONS={
269:[('佈局與開關速度同時影響發熱及 EMI。','Layout and switching speed affect both heat and EMI.','熱模型追蹤能量和溫度；EMI 模型追蹤共模、差模及頻譜。','Thermal models track energy/temperature; EMI models track modes and spectra.'),('牽引逆變器需要由損耗推算接面溫升。','Traction inverters need junction rise predicted from losses.','SiC 器件開關損耗依工作點和寄生；不可直接套用示例熱阻。','SiC switching losses depend on operating point/parasitics; example resistances do not transfer unchanged.')],
270:[('隔離通訊的電源與資料線同樣存在共模回路。','Isolated communications have common-mode paths through power and data.','通訊還需驗證 bit 時序與誤碼，不以 EMI 衰減替代。','Communications also need bit timing/error validation, not only EMI attenuation.'),('熱與 EMI 都受開關頻率和佈局影響。','Heat and EMI both depend on switching frequency and layout.','降低邊緣速度可改善某些噪聲但增加開關損耗，需重新平衡。','Slower edges may reduce noise but increase switching loss, requiring a new balance.')],
271:[('類比前端必須把訊號準確交給 ADC。','An analog front end must accurately deliver signals to an ADC.','高速 ADC 的取樣回踢、時鐘和介面限制不同於慢速直流精度。','High-speed ADC kickback, clock and interface limits differ from slow DC accuracy.'),('ADC 與 DAC 兩方向都依參考和誤差預算。','Both conversion directions depend on references and error budgets.','DAC 需額外驗證輸出負載、毛刺與建立時間。','DACs additionally need output-load, glitch and settling checks.')],
272:[('兩類放大器都需增益、匹配和穩定性分析。','Both amplifier types need gain, matching and stability analysis.','LNA 優先弱訊號雜訊；PA 著重大訊號效率與線性。','LNAs prioritize weak-signal noise; PAs emphasize large-signal efficiency/linearity.'),('LNA 是 SDR 接收鏈的前級雜訊來源。','An LNA is an early noise contributor in an SDR receiver.','SDR 的 AGC 和數位抽取會改變整條訊號鏈的工作情境。','SDR AGC and decimation change the full-chain operating context.')],
273:[('PLL 時鐘抖動直接限制高速取樣 SNR。','PLL clock jitter directly limits high-speed sampling SNR.','ADC 的限制隨類比輸入頻率變化，不能只看載波相噪單點。','ADC limits depend on analog input frequency, not one phase-noise point.'),('SDR 本地振盪器依賴合成器切頻與相噪。','SDR local oscillators depend on synthesizer hopping and phase noise.','SDR 還有 IQ、AGC 和資料流校準，PLL 鎖定不代表接收器校準完成。','SDR adds IQ, AGC and data-path calibration; PLL lock is not receiver calibration.')],
274:[('ADC 與訊號調理共同決定量測動態範圍。','ADC and conditioning jointly determine measurement dynamic range.','前端增益增加會改變 ADC 頭部空間，不能只提高放大倍數。','More front-end gain changes ADC headroom; gain cannot simply be maximized.'),('低抖動 PLL 是 ADC 時钟來源之一。','A low-jitter PLL is one ADC clock source.','PLL 相噪積分範圍須與 ADC 使用條件對應。','PLL integration limits must match ADC use conditions.')],
275:[('DAC 輸出也需要精密放大、參考和回流設計。','DAC outputs also need precision amplification, reference and return design.','輸出負載穩定性與輸入感測阻抗問題方向相反。','Output-load stability is a different boundary from sensor-input loading.'),('資料轉換共同使用碼值、線性及噪聲語言。','Data converters share codes, linearity and noise concepts.','ADC 量化輸入，DAC 重建輸出；FFT 和建立量測路徑不同。','ADCs quantize input and DACs reconstruct output, requiring different FFT/settling paths.')],
276:[('射頻鏈共享匹配與穩定性分析。','RF chains share matching and stability analysis.','大訊號 PA 的最佳負載不等於 LNA 的最佳雜訊源。','A PA optimum large-signal load differs from an LNA optimum noise source.'),('PA 輸出須與射頻濾波及雙工器共同評估。','PA output must be evaluated with filters/duplexers.','聲學濾波器的功率承受及溫漂需另外核對。','Acoustic-filter power handling and drift need separate checks.')],
277:[('LNA 前的濾波損耗進入接收雜訊預算。','Pre-LNA filter loss enters receiver noise budgets.','通帶低損與阻帶強抑制需依阻塞情境取捨。','Low loss and rejection trade off according to blocker conditions.'),('發射濾波器承受 PA 的調變與功率。','Transmit filters handle PA modulation and power.','濾波不能消除所有帶內 PA 非線性失真。','Filtering cannot remove all in-band PA nonlinear distortion.')],
278:[('陣列中的每個單元仍需要阻抗和效率驗證。','Every array element still needs impedance/efficiency checks.','掃描和互耦會改變有效阻抗，不能複製孤立單元結論。','Scanning/coupling change active impedance, invalidating direct isolated-element transfer.'),('天線和濾波器都使用射頻參考面及 S 參數。','Antennas and filters both use RF reference planes and S parameters.','天線有輻射方向圖；濾波插損不能替代輻射效率。','Antennas radiate patterns; filter insertion loss cannot replace radiation efficiency.')],
279:[('天線單元的方向圖與匹配影響陣列合成。','Element patterns and matching affect array synthesis.','陣列需另評估空間混疊、相位誤差與互耦。','Arrays additionally need spatial-alias, phase-error and coupling analysis.'),('合成器提供陣列通道所需的頻率和相位參考。','Synthesizers provide frequency/phase references for array channels.','共用頻率不保證相位同步，需跨通道校準。','Shared frequency does not guarantee phase alignment; cross-channel calibration is needed.')],
280:[('SDR 前端的雜訊與阻塞取捨包含 LNA。','SDR front-end noise/blocker trade-offs include the LNA.','系統 AGC 和 ADC 限幅會新增動態限制。','System AGC and ADC clipping introduce dynamic limits.'),('SDR 需要 PLL 產生和切換本地振盪頻率。','SDR uses PLLs to generate/switch local oscillators.','混頻後仍需 IQ 和 DC 校準，不能以鎖定旗標替代。','IQ/DC calibration remains after mixing and cannot be replaced by a lock flag.')],
281:[('HDI 保留多層板堆疊與回流設計原則。','HDI retains multilayer stackup and return-path principles.','微孔增層帶來不同孔底界面、壓合與檢驗要求。','Microvia buildup adds different bottom interfaces, lamination and inspection needs.'),('軟硬複合板也需要層疊、連通與阻抗控制。','Rigid-flex also needs stackup, connectivity and impedance control.','活動彎折引入中性軸和銅疲勞，不可只沿用剛板厚度。','Dynamic bending adds neutral-axis and copper-fatigue limits; rigid thickness rules do not transfer.')],
282:[('HDI 是多層互連向更高密度的延伸。','HDI extends multilayer interconnects toward higher density.','孔長、孔底和壓合次數改變可靠度與成本。','Via depth, bottoms and lamination cycles alter reliability/cost.'),('密集板的不可接觸節點提高邊界掃描價值。','Inaccessible dense-board nodes increase boundary-scan value.','掃描可驗連通，但無法取代微孔截面和疲勞證據。','Scan checks connectivity but cannot replace microvia sections/fatigue evidence.')],
283:[('剛柔板沿用多層介電和銅連接的基本模型。','Rigid-flex uses multilayer dielectric/copper models.','柔性區需額外處理彎折方向、補強和中性軸。','Flex regions add bend direction, stiffeners and neutral-axis issues.'),('車用環境耐久可檢驗反覆彎折與熱循環交互。','Automotive durability can examine flex/thermal-cycle interaction.','需依實際任務次數和固定方式定義，不套用通用彎曲次數。','Define actual cycles/mounting rather than a universal bend count.')],
284:[('SMT 線將印刷貼裝結果交給回焊形成接點。','SMT transfers printed/placed assemblies to reflow for joining.','爐設定不是工件溫度；不同材料和熱容量要重驗。','Oven settings are not workpiece temperature; materials/thermal mass need revalidation.'),('AOI 與 SPI 的同座標資料可回饋生產線。','Registered AOI/SPI data can feed back to the line.','檢測門檻和誤報必須獨立驗證，不能把所有警報當根因。','Thresholds/false calls need independent checks; not every alarm is a root cause.')],
285:[('回焊和選焊都接續組装資料與材料追溯。','Reflow/selective soldering both depend on assembly data/material traceability.','選焊有噴嘴可達性與通孔填充，回焊以全板熱曲線為核心。','Selective soldering adds nozzle access/hole fill; reflow centers on whole-board profiles.'),('熱歷程形成的界面影響車用長期疲勞。','Thermally formed interfaces affect automotive fatigue.','外觀一次合格不能代表經環境循環後仍可靠。','Initial visual acceptance does not prove post-cycling reliability.')],
286:[('AOI 能把缺陷資訊回饋到印刷和貼裝。','AOI can return defect information to printing/placement.','需配準位置和料版，相關關係不能直接當因果。','Locations/revisions must align; correlation is not causation.'),('AOI 與邊界掃描提供外觀及電性互補。','AOI and boundary scan provide visual/electrical complements.','可見焊點良好不保證內部連通，掃描通過不保證焊點形貌。','Visible joints do not prove internal connectivity; scan does not prove morphology.')],
287:[('PCB 設計階段可預先規劃掃描鏈和可觀察節點。','PCB design can plan scan chains and observable nodes.','板製造的截面、阻抗仍需要掃描以外證據。','Fabrication sections/impedance still need evidence beyond scan.'),('邊界掃描與 AOI 可互補找出不同失效類型。','Boundary scan and AOI find complementary fault classes.','兩者覆蓋分母不同，不能直接相加成 100%。','Coverage denominators differ and cannot simply add to 100%.')],
288:[('SMT 每個搬運環節都需要靜電控制。','Every SMT handling transfer needs ESD control.','製程良率和 ESD 潛在損傷不同，初測通過不能排除後者。','Yield and latent ESD damage differ; initial passing cannot exclude the latter.'),('ESD 與車用耐久都重視機制和證據。','ESD and automotive durability both depend on mechanisms/evidence.','器件 HBM/CDM 資格與整機端口及長期環境不同。','Device HBM/CDM qualification differs from product ports/long-term environment.')],
289:[('功率電子熱模型提供耐久的溫度任務剖面。','Power-thermal models provide durability temperature profiles.','穩態最高溫不等於循環疲勞，需要時間歷程。','Maximum steady temperature is not cyclic fatigue; time histories are needed.'),('焊接材料和界面成為環境疲勞的重要起點。','Solder materials/interfaces are starting points for environmental fatigue.','製程合格與壽命驗證不同，需保留老化後證據。','Process acceptance differs from life validation and needs aged evidence.')],
290:[('工業隔離通訊也需完整的電源和資料屏障。','Industrial isolated communication also needs complete power/data barriers.','患者連接的分類與保護要求不能直接套用工業規格。','Patient-connection classifications/protection do not transfer from industrial ratings.'),('醫療供電的共模電容同時影響 EMI 與漏電。','Medical-supply common-mode capacitance affects both EMI and leakage.','降低 EMI 的跨屏障電容取捨需重新評估系統漏電。','Barrier capacitors used for EMI require reevaluating system leakage.')],
291:[('LED 結溫需從驅動損耗與散熱路徑估算。','LED junction temperature needs loss/thermal-path estimation.','電能轉光比例隨電流溫度改變，不把全部功率當光或熱。','Electrical-to-light fraction varies; do not classify all power as only light or heat.'),('市電 LED 驅動可能需要功率因數校正。','Mains LED drivers may need power-factor correction.','PFC 的輸入電流目標和 LED 端恆流是不同迴路。','PFC input-current goals differ from LED constant-current regulation.')],
292:[('兩種顯示都需定址、資料傳輸和更新策略。','Both displays need addressing, transport and update strategy.','電子紙反射雙穩態，OLED 自發光；功耗模型不能照搬。','Reflective bistable e-paper and emissive OLED need different power models.'),('電子紙產品可搭配電容觸控介面。','E-paper products can include capacitive touch.','顯示驅動波形可能干擾感測，需協調掃描時序。','Display waveforms may disturb sensing and require timing coordination.')],
293:[('OLED 與電子紙都把資料碼映射成可見影像。','OLED and e-paper both map codes to visible images.','自發光老化與電泳殘影是不同機制，不共用補償假設。','Emissive aging and electrophoretic ghosting differ and need different compensation assumptions.'),('OLED 與 LED 共享電流、發光和熱耦合問題。','OLED and LED share current/light/thermal coupling.','TFT 像素矩陣、刷新和色彩校準帶來額外條件。','TFT matrices, refresh and color calibration add constraints.')],
294:[('電子紙與觸控可整合成低功耗閱讀介面。','E-paper and touch can form a low-power reading interface.','雙穩態顯示不代表觸控掃描零功耗。','A bistable display does not make touch scanning energy-free.'),('工業感測與觸控都需要對抗共模與電源干擾。','Industrial sensors and touch both face common-mode/supply interference.','触控的電場和基線模型不同於差動數位匯流排。','Touch fields/baselines differ from differential digital buses.')],
295:[('超音波換能器同樣包含壓電耦合和機械共振。','Ultrasonic transducers also use piezoelectric coupling/resonance.','定位重視準靜態行程，測距重視脈衝和回波。','Positioning emphasizes quasi-static stroke; ranging emphasizes bursts/echoes.'),('致動器回授可借用位置感測和伺服的誤差模型。','Actuator feedback uses position sensing and servo error models.','壓電遲滯、蠕變和容性負載不同於旋轉馬達。','Piezo hysteresis, creep and capacitive load differ from rotary motors.')],
296:[('聲波換能與壓電驅動共享 BVD 及電容電流模型。','Acoustic conversion and piezo drives share BVD/current models.','換能測距還需聲速、多路徑和接收恢復分析。','Ranging additionally needs sound speed, multipath and receiver recovery.'),('超音波接收需要低雜訊放大與動態範圍分配。','Ultrasonic receivers need low-noise conditioning/dynamic-range allocation.','時變增益與發射後盲區不同於穩態精密量測。','Time-varying gain and post-transmit blanking differ from steady precision measurement.')],
297:[('隔離通訊的纜線和電源同樣需要 EMI 路徑分析。','Isolated bus cables/power need EMI path analysis.','合規頻譜不能代替通訊 bit 錯誤和延遲驗證。','Compliance spectra cannot replace bit-error/latency checks.'),('醫療與工業隔離共享屏障和寄生电容概念。','Medical and industrial isolation share barrier/parasitic concepts.','適用使用分類、漏電和故障要求不同。','Applicable classification, leakage and fault requirements differ.')],
298:[('新北本是高壓直流換流站原理的公開工程案例。','The new link is a public case for HVDC converter principles.','實體案例有特定 2019 額定及交流邊界，不能套成所有站。','It has specific 2019 ratings/AC boundaries, not universal station parameters.'),('VSC 技術可連到模組化多電平的控制與能量課題。','VSC technology connects to modular-multilevel control/energy topics.','供應商實際模組與控制細節不能由通用示意推定。','Actual supplier modules/control cannot be inferred from generic diagrams.')],
299:[('IFA 展示海纜與陸端工程的整合。','IFA demonstrates submarine-cable/land-terminal integration.','海纜課著重材料與敷設邊界，IFA 另含跨國營運制度。','Cable study emphasizes material/installation boundaries; IFA adds cross-border operations.'),('IFA 與紐西蘭都把海峽兩側的交流網經 HVDC 連接。','IFA and New Zealand both link AC networks across straits through HVDC.','水力互補、跨國市場與既有極線年代不同。','Hydro complementarity, cross-border markets and pole eras differ.')],
300:[('兩個島嶼案例都用 HVDC 增加調度選擇。','Both island cases use HVDC to increase dispatch options.','新北本含 2019 VSC 增建；紐西蘭需要區分長期極線更新。','New Hokkaido includes a 2019 VSC addition; New Zealand has multiple pole-renewal eras.'),('IFA 和南北島連線都需海纜資產維護與可用性規劃。','IFA and the inter-island link need cable-asset maintenance/availability planning.','跨國交易與國內水力互補的需求情境不同。','Cross-border trade and domestic hydro complementarity have different needs.')],
}
src('piezo-position','壓電致動器遲滯、蠕變與位移','Displacement behavior of piezoelectric actuators','Physik Instrumente','https://www.physikinstrumente.com/en/expertise/technology/piezo-technology/properties-piezo-actuators/displacement-behavior/')
src('piezo-force','壓電致動器力與剛度','Forces and stiffnesses of piezoelectric actuators','Physik Instrumente','https://www.physikinstrumente.com/en/expertise/technology/piezo-technology/properties-piezo-actuators/forces-stiffnesses')
src('ifa-recovery','IFA 火災後恢復全容量的歷史公告','IFA return to full service following fire','National Grid','https://www.nationalgrid.com/national-grid-interconnectors-have-busiest-january-record-26twh-power-transported-strengthen')
